      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>Scope — which objects Smart Bake analyzes.

Auto (Whole Scene) (default) — scans the whole scene and bakes only what is actually driven: by a constraint, driven key or driver, expression, IK, or motion path.
Selected — restricts the scan to the current selection.</string>
      </property>
